# Exact versions of the evaluation host's environment: CPython 3.12, Linux x86_64.
# The set that passed the real-model slow tests, recorded with `pip freeze`, without
# pip (requirements/eval-pip.lock), torch (requirements/eval-torch.lock) and the
# project itself. Versions are pinned exactly and not re-resolved, so the lock holds
# what was tested (DD-032). To change a version: edit this file, regenerate
# requirements/eval.lock with the command in its header, and rerun the slow tests on
# the evaluation host.
